## 🚀 1. Phase 2: Cloud Autonomy (The Bridge)
We have successfully deployed the **Marketing Dashboard** to Google Cloud Run.
This provides a 24/7 web interface for monitoring the Marketing Log and Strategy.

*   **URL:** [Live Dashboard](https://marketing-dashboard-7an2ps6yna-uc.a.run.app)
*   **Auth:** Secured via Firebase (Google Sign-In).
*   **Infrastructure:** Cloud Build -> Cloud Run (`us-central1`).

## 🤖 2. Phase 3: The Coder Agent (The Hands)
We have implemented the **Level 5 Autonomous Coder**.
The agent can now modify the local filesystem to implement features, fix bugs, and refactor code.

*   **Capability:** `CodeOps` (Read/Write/Exec).
*   **Persona:** `Developer` (Senior Engineer).
*   **Invocation:** [brain_spawn_agent(intent="...", persona="developer")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#3661-3716).

